**Profile**: Origin: Huanglong.

'''Norfall Barrens''' is a region in [[Huanglong]]. It is a dangerous area with hostile Tacet Discords. The area consists of a narrow passageway from [[Desorock Highland]] reaching down into the central area of the barrens. It contains the titanic [[Ovathrax]] statue along with many floating buildings. 

